  "cost": { "wallClockMinutes": 13, "workedBy": "agent", "notes": "2 x 404 on guessed URLs + 2 searches + 1 handbook fetch. The handbook's Section 1.3 list is the whole rule; the caps ($1,500 / $1,000) are from the 2022 manual release and may have changed." },
  "surprises": [
    "The clearest 'unit of work' anomaly in the corpus: eligibility is entirely about a DEAD person's program enrolment, and the applicant is a business (the funeral home). pipeline-principles.md §1 says 'a program, not an excerpt' assuming a person seeking help -- WFCAP breaks that frame while still being a real safety-net benefit a grieving family should know exists."
